  <div class="metric">
    <span class="tag">The result</span>
    5,000-order runs became a <strong>routine daily test</strong>, with the order-creation API averaging
    ~1.2 seconds while the pipeline runs at full load. Every queue split, though, leaves something new to
    run — which is how a platform that began with three worker containers ended up with a fleet to manage.
    That is the next case.
  </div>
